# 🛠️ SupportFlow – Ticket Resolution System (v2: REST APIs)

This branch (`v2-rest-api`) is part of a full-stack project series where we build a Customer Support Ticketing App using Spring Boot (backend) and React (frontend).

---

## What's Implemented in This Branch

This version contains:

- `TicketController` with full REST API support
  - `GET /tickets` – Get all tickets
  - `POST /tickets` – Create new ticket
  - `PUT /tickets/{id}` – Update existing ticket
  - `DELETE /tickets/{id}` – Delete ticket
   Connected to MySQL using Spring Data JPA
- `Ticket` entity and basic validation
- JSON request/response structure ready for frontend integration
- Base URL: `http://localhost:8080/api/tickets`

